{'symbol': 'CB', 'date': '2021-12-20 16:30:00', 'title': 'CHUBB SUPPORTS LANDMARK DEBT-FOR-NATURE RESTRUCTURING PROJECT IN BELIZE', 'text': "ZURICH, DEC. 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CHUBB TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS SUPPORT FOR THE U.S. INTERNATIONAL DEVELOPMENT FINANCE CORPORATION'S (DFC) PARTICIPATION IN A LANDMARK DEBT RESTRUCTURING AND OCEAN CONSERVATION PROJECT IN BELIZE.\xa0 CHUBB GLOBAL MARKETS AND SOVEREIGN RISK INSURANCE LIMITED, A CHUBB COMPANY, TOGETHER WITH OTHER PRIVATE INSURERS, PROVIDED $300 MILLION OF REINSURANCE TO DFC IN AN INNOVATIVE POLITICAL RISK INSURANCE TRANSACTION DESIGNED TO HELP BELIZE REDUCE ITS EXTERNAL GOVERNMENT DEBT AND FUND MARINE PROTECTION."}